stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CREATED
  CREATED --> PROVISIONED
  PROVISIONED --> COMMITTED
  COMMITTED --> RUNNING
  RUNNING --> SEALED
  SEALED --> REVEALED
  REVEALED --> EVALUATED
  EVALUATED --> DESTROYED
  RUNNING --> DESTROYED: failure / cleanup

